 10-29-2005 | <= | -infinity                    | Sat Oct 29 23:59:59.999999 2005 NDT | Sat Oct 29 23:01:00 2005 NST | Sat Oct 29 23:59:59.999999 2005 NST
 10-29-2005 | =  | Sat Oct 29 00:00:00 2005 NDT | Sat Oct 29 23:59:59.999999 2005 NDT | Sat Oct 29 23:01:00 2005 NST | Sat Oct 29 23:59:59.999999 2005 NST
 10-29-2005 | >  | Sun Oct 30 00:00:00 2005 NDT | Sun Oct 30 00:00:59.999999 2005 NDT | Sun Oct 30 00:00:00 2005 NST | infinity
 10-29-2005 | >= | Sat Oct 29 00:00:00 2005 NDT | infinity                            | Sat Oct 29 00:00:00 2005 NDT | Fri Oct 28 23:59:59.999999 2005 NDT
 10-30-2005 | <  | -infinity                    | Sat Oct 29 23:59:59.999999 2005 NDT | Sat Oct 29 23:01:00 2005 NST | Sat Oct 29 23:59:59.999999 2005 NST
 10-30-2005 | <= | -infinity                    | Sun Oct 30 23:59:59.999999 2005 NST | Mon Oct 31 00:00:00 2005 NST | Sun Oct 30 23:59:59.999999 2005 NST
 10-30-2005 | =  | Sun Oct 30 00:00:00 2005 NDT | Sun Oct 30 00:00:59.999999 2005 NDT | Sun Oct 30 00:00:00 2005 NST | Sun Oct 30 23:59:59.999999 2005 NST
 10-30-2005 | >  | Mon Oct 31 00:00:00 2005 NST | infinity                            | Mon Oct 31 00:00:00 2005 NST | Sun Oct 30 23:59:59.999999 2005 NST
